# 🦕 Primordium

A beautifully designed website dedicated to extinct animals — exploring the fascinating creatures that once roamed our planet.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HTML5** — Semantic and accessible markup
- **CSS3** — Modern styling with Flexbox & Grid
- **Responsive Design** — Fully responsive across all devices

